        "title": "A must visit if you are in Kathmandu",
        "text": "Pashupatinath Temple is one of the must-visit places in Kathmandu. It’s one of the most important Hindu temples in the region, and the whole area has a very intense and authentic atmosphere.\n\nEvery evening there’s a ceremony (aarti) by the river, which is definitely worth seeing. It draws both locals and visitors, and it gives you a real sense of the spiritual life of the city.\n\nIf you walk up the surrounding hills, you’ll also find more temples and viewpoints, which are much quieter and offer a different perspective of the complex and the river below.",
