        "title": "Hinduism Core",
        "text": "Take time to explore the site, it's massive, and ideally, bring along a guide that will take the time to explain all the importance of this place to you. From families Pusa to cremations rites, Pashupatinath is central to the Hinduist community's life. It would be too long to explain here, but get a guide and spend at least half a day visiting this UNESCO World Heritage Site, you will not be disappointed.",
