        "title": "I think a tour would make this a 5 star experience",
        "text": "A must-visit experience in Kathmandu.  The complex of buildings is filled with people, pigeons and the pagentry of onsite cremations.   I visited with a guide (with little narration)  and I think my experience here would have been significantly enhanced if I had taken a tour with someone who specializes in the facility.  I particularly wish I had attended the aarati pooja (also with someone who would elaborate).  Having said that I learned alot and am glad I visited.",
